   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Can anyone offer some suggestions or good resources for writing the output of unmarked S4 objects to a csv or txt file? I am trying to output a list of model results (using pcount) and also a list of results from the modSel function. Thanks for any suggestions.<br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "QmV-DJ7NDwAJ",
   "from": "Richard Chandler",
   "author": "403be63af7ebf220",
   "date": "2020-02-03T20:41:24Z",
   "subject": "RE: [unmarked] writing s4 output to csv",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"#954F72\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Hi Scott,<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">You should convert the results to a data.frame first, and then export the data.frame using write.csv() or a similar function. See the example at the end the help page for\r\n modSel():<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<pre><span style=\"color:black\">ms &lt;- modSel(fl, nullmod=&quot;Null&quot;)<u></u><u></u></span></pre>\r\n<pre><span style=\"color:black\">ms<u></u><u></u></span></pre>\r\n<pre><span style=\"color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></pre>\r\n<pre><span style=\"color:black\">coef(ms)                            # Estimates only<u></u><u></u></span></pre>\r\n<pre><span style=\"color:black\">SE(ms)                              # Standard errors only<u></u><u></u></span></pre>\r\n<pre><span style=\"color:black\">(toExport &lt;- as(ms, &quot;data.frame&quot;))  # Everything<u></u><u></u></span></pre>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><u></u> <u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\">Richard<u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;vertical-align:baseline\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">--<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Richard Chandler<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Associate Professor<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Wildlife Ecology and Conservation<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">Warnell School of Forestry and Natural Resources<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\">University of Georgia<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><a href=\"tel:(706)%20542-5815\" value=\"+17065425815\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">706-542-5815</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,sans-serif;color:black\"><a href=\"http://chandlerlab.uga.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://chandlerlab.uga.edu/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792450668712000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2FurNQ8pI5Yr0y0toP9DB_\"><span style=\"border:none windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in\">http://chandl